6. Data Retention

We retain account data for as long as your account is active. Generated content and assets are retained until you delete them or close your account, subject to reasonable backup retention periods. We may retain limited data after account closure where required for legal, tax, security, or dispute-resolution purposes.

7. Your Rights

Depending on your location, you may have the right to:


Access, correct, or delete your personal information
Object to or restrict certain processing
Request data portability
Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent
Lodge a complaint with a data protection authority


To exercise these rights, contact us using the details in Section 12. We will respond within the timeframe required by applicable law.

7.1 California Residents

California residents have rights under the CCPA/CPRA, including the right to know, delete, correct, and opt out of the sale or sharing of personal information. We do not sell or share personal information as those terms are defined under the CCPA/CPRA.

8. Cookies and Tracking

We use cookies and similar technologies for:


Essential functions (login sessions, security)
Preference storage
Analytics (where enabled), to understand feature usage and improve the Platform


You can control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling essential cookies may limit Platform functionality.

9. Data Security

We implement technical and organizational measures — including encryption in transit, access controls, and infrastructure-level safeguards — designed to protect your information. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.

10. International Data Transfers

Your information may be processed and stored in countries other than your own, including the United States and countries where our infrastructure and service providers operate. Where required, we rely on appropriate safeguards (such as standard contractual clauses) for such transfers.

11. Children's Privacy

The Platform is not directed to individuals under 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us so we can delete it.

